{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;Welcome, you. This is SimPlaE \u2014 a device that simulates multiple worlds.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/9ef9dca29739d1822b8377f4217c8419.avif?t=1770627712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras_big/9ef9dca29739d1822b8377f4217c8419.webp?t=1770627712 width=1560 height=1561 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;We will now begin the tutorial.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play platformers through simulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/662e3bad1f30d91d501cc67f2746961c.avif?t=1770627712\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rule 1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters move on their own, interacting with the given terrain according to certain conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot directly control the characters\u2019 movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/f8391bf67deec8d7b7f908a880fbfb51.poster.avif?t=1770627712\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/f8391bf67deec8d7b7f908a880fbfb51.webm?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/f8391bf67deec8d7b7f908a880fbfb51.mp4?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rule 2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify the characters\u2019 behavioral patterns through <strong>Observation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop the resources provided in the slot to <strong>Place</strong> them and design new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/4865c929cb2c9f642f3a7eaa62e7d928.poster.avif?t=1770627712\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/4865c929cb2c9f642f3a7eaa62e7d928.webm?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/4865c929cb2c9f642f3a7eaa62e7d928.mp4?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If needed, actively use hints and tooltips. They can help inspire new ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/588eef6bafb260d62d516669c4e0caf7.poster.avif?t=1770627712\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/588eef6bafb260d62d516669c4e0caf7.webm?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/588eef6bafb260d62d516669c4e0caf7.mp4?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rule 3</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple ways to clear a simulation, but only one optimal solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SimPlaE will evaluate your choices and assign a grade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/14f5482ff3b8d87675484023b8ad5746.poster.avif?t=1770627712\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/14f5482ff3b8d87675484023b8ad5746.webm?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/14f5482ff3b8d87675484023b8ad5746.mp4?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear levels and face a variety of challenges and gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New terrain and character movements await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/4856515a2b2fe31735c14f8145cbe1a6.poster.avif?t=1770627712\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/4856515a2b2fe31735c14f8145cbe1a6.webm?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/4856515a2b2fe31735c14f8145cbe1a6.mp4?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SimPlaE contains a variety of simulated platformer worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the simulation will need your help to achieve their wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/d96723b3ef413a98f9197ade518acdfa.poster.avif?t=1770627712\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/d96723b3ef413a98f9197ade518acdfa.webm?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/d96723b3ef413a98f9197ade518acdfa.mp4?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Administrator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the purpose of the simulation? What ending awaits at its conclusion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/137aedf59bc4608ff78332c35ff03854.poster.avif?t=1770627712\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/137aedf59bc4608ff78332c35ff03854.webm?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150000/extras/137aedf59bc4608ff78332c35ff03854.mp4?t=1770627712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;We will be watching your decisions with great interest. Good luck.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes 20 levels, which is 20% of the full game\u2019s content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full release will f